    "description": "<p>The Abyssal lunges towards and past his opponent in a single perfect motion, striking so fast that his victim's corpse still stands when he glances back over his shoulder to watch them fall in half. Ebon Lightning Prana allows the Abyssal to move up to (Essence x 8) yards and then make a single Melee attack against an opponent. The Deathknight must have a valid target in range to use this Charm.</p><p>With Essence 3+, the Abyssal can reflexively roll (Dexterity + Stealth) to establish surprise as part of the movement granted by this Charm, paying an additional five motes to do so.</p>",
